      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "titleblock-div-0",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-title-block\">\n        <h1>THE AMERICAN CYCLOPÆDIA (1879)</h1>\n        <h2>BY MARK TWAIN</h2>\n\n    </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "prologue-div-1",
          "text": "<div class=\"book-text-content\">\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <p><span><b>Volumes</b></span> </p>\n        </div>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "id": "prologue-div-2",
          "text": "<div class=\"block-center\">\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Preface\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Preface\">Preface</a></li>\n            </ul>\n            <ul>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_I:_A_-_Asher\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume I: A - Asher\">I: A - Asher</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_II:_Ashes_-_Bol\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume II: Ashes - Bol\">II: Ashes - Bol</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_III:_Bolan_Pass_-_Carmine\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume III: Bolan Pass - Carmine\">III: Bolan Pass -\n                        Carmine</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_IV:_Carmona_-_Coddington\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume IV: Carmona - Coddington\">IV: Carmona - Coddington</a>\n                </li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_V:_Code_-_Demotica\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume V: Code - Demotica\">V: Code - Demotica</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_VI:_Dempster_-_Everett\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume VI: Dempster - Everett\">VI: Dempster - Everett</a>\n                </li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_VII:_Evesham_-_Glascock\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume VII: Evesham - Glascock\">VII: Evesham -\n                        Glascock</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_VIII:_Glasgow_-_Hortense\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume VIII: Glasgow - Hortense\">VIII: Glasgow -\n                        Hortense</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_IX:_Hortensius_-_Kingslake\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume IX: Hortensius - Kingslake\">IX: Hortensius - Kingslake</a>\n                </li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_X:_Kinglet_-_Magnet\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume X: Kinglet - Magnet\">X: Kinglet - Magnet</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_XI:_Magnetism_-_Motril\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume XI: Magnetism - Motril\">XI: Magnetism - Motril</a>\n                </li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_XII:_Mott_-_Pales\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume XII: Mott - Pales\">XII: Mott - Pales</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_XIII:_Palestine_-_Printing\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume XIII: Palestine - Printing\">XIII: Palestine - Printing</a>\n                </li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_XIV:_Prior_-_Shoe\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume XIV: Prior - Shoe\">XIV: Prior - Shoe</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_XV:_Shomer_-_Trollope\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume XV: Shomer - Trollope\">XV: Shomer - Trollope</a>\n                </li>\n                <li><a href=\"/wiki/The_American_Cyclop%C3%A6dia_(1879)/Volume_XVI:_Trombone_-_Zymosis\"\n                        title=\"The American Cyclopædia (1879)/Volume XVI: Trombone - Zymosis\">XVI: Trombone -\n                        Zymosis</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>"
        }
